<title>USA: MedPartners says acquires Piedmont IPA.</title>
<headline>MedPartners says acquires Piedmont IPA.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>MedPartners Inc said Monday it acquired Piedmont IPA, a network of 172 physicians in Durham, N.C..</p>
<p>The company said the network includes 60 primary care physicians and 116 specialty providers.</p>
<p>A company spokesman declined to disclose a purchase price.</p>
